# Wallet API Test Collection
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or import to Postman

### Variables
@baseURL = http://localhost:8000
@token = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@userId = YOUR_USER_UUID_HERE

###############################################
# AUTHENTICATION
###############################################

### Register User
POST {{baseURL}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wallet_test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123456",
  "full_name": "Wallet Test User",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-01-15",
  "phone_number": "+1234567890"
}

### Login
POST {{baseURL}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wallet_test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123456"
}

###############################################
# PUBLIC WALLET API (Requires Auth)
###############################################

### 1. Get Wallet Balance & History
GET {{baseURL}}/api/v1/wallet/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Top-Up Wallet (Valid Amount)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/v1/wallet/topup-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000
}

### 3. Top-Up Wallet (Invalid Amount - Should Fail)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/v1/wallet/topup-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000
}

### 4. Top-Up Again (Add More)
POST {{baseURL}}/api/v1/wallet/topup-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 25000
}

###############################################
# HMVC WALLET API (Internal - No Auth)
###############################################

### 5. Credit Wallet (HMVC)
POST {{baseURL}}/hmvc/wallet/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 25000,
  "reference_id": "payment-12345",
  "description": "Top-up via bank transfer"
}

### 6. Deduct Wallet (HMVC - Success)
POST {{baseURL}}/hmvc/wallet/deduct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 30000,
  "reference_id": "order-67890",
  "description": "Purchase: E-Book Collection"
}

### 7. Deduct Wallet (HMVC - Insufficient Balance)
POST {{baseURL}}/hmvc/wallet/deduct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 100000,
  "reference_id": "order-99999",
  "description": "Purchase: Premium Package"
}

### 8. Credit with Custom Description
POST {{baseURL}}/hmvc/wallet/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 15000,
  "reference_id": "refund-555",
  "description": "Refund for cancelled order"
}

###############################################
# VERIFICATION
###############################################

### Check Final Balance
GET {{baseURL}}/api/v1/wallet/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
